<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Full-stack systems for businesses that run 24/7</div><h1>Replace repetitive work with <span>systems that scale.</span></h1><p>I design and ship full-stack applications and custom integrations that remove operational bottlenecks, synchronize business data, and keep critical workflows moving around the clock.</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="#work">View My Automation Projects →</a><a class="secondary" href="{{ route('contact') }}">Let's Talk Business</a></div><p class="note">Rapid Application Development for founders and teams that value speed, ownership, and measurable efficiency.</p></div><div class="card"><label>Operational outcome</label><h2 style="color:#1a1a1a">From business event to completed action—without manual intervention.</h2><div class="flow"><div style="color:#1a1a1a"><b>1</b>A customer or team event starts the workflow</div><div style="color:#1a1a1a"><b>2</b>Integrated systems validate and synchronize data</div><div style="color:#1a1a1a"><b>3</b>The business outcome completes automatically, 24/7</div></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="services"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">What I do</div><h2>Engineering systems that remove operational drag.</h2><p class="intro">I combine rapid application development, integration engineering, and production deployment to turn complex operating requirements into dependable software.</p><div class="service-grid"><div class="panel"><h3>Application Architecture</h3><ul><li>Full-stack web applications</li><li>Secure user authentication and role-based access</li><li>Operational dashboards and reporting views</li></ul></div><div class="panel"><h3>Workflow Automation &amp; Logic</h3><ul><li>Webhook-driven business events</li><li>System triggers and conditional logic</li><li>Automated data synchronization across platforms</li></ul></div><div class="panel"><h3>Version Control &amp; Data Management</h3><ul><li>GitHub repository architecture and release history</li><li>Database handling and structured data flows</li><li>Maintainable, auditable implementation standards</li></ul></div><div class="panel"><h3>Infrastructure &amp; Deployment</h3><ul><li>Cloud server staging and production launch</li><li>Environment configuration and deployment readiness</li><li>Complete client code ownership and handover</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="section projects" id="work"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Selected systems</div><h2>Production-minded applications with measurable operating value.</h2><p class="intro">Each system is designed around a business process, engineered for reliability, and available to review through a live deployment.</p><div class="grid3"><article class="project"><img src="{{ asset('images/educational-product-promo-gurogrid.png') }}" alt="GuroGrid automated digital commerce system"><div class="project-body"><h3>Automated Digital Commerce</h3><ul class="project-points"><li><strong>The Tech:</strong> Full-stack storefront, webhook integrations, structured customer data, and cloud deployment.</li><li><strong>The Workflow:</strong> Purchase events trigger fulfillment, delivery, and real-time record synchronization automatically.</li><li><strong>The Business Impact:</strong> A 100% hands-free, 24/7 storefront with digital products delivered in 1–3 minutes.</li></ul><a class="status" href="https://gurogrid.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Live Project ↗</a></div></article><article class="project"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=85" alt="ResortFlow resort booking management system"><div class="project-body"><h3>Hospitality Operations</h3><ul class="project-points"><li><strong>The Tech:</strong> Custom booking management application with authenticated operational views and structured data handling.</li><li><strong>The Workflow:</strong> Reservation activity updates availability in real time across the booking and management experience.</li><li><strong>The Business Impact:</strong> Replaces disconnected spreadsheets with a centralized operating system for resort teams.</li></ul><a class="status" href="https://resortflowsample.maamlyn.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Live Project ↗</a></div></article><article class="project"><img src="{{ asset('images/driveflow-thumbnail.png') }}" alt="DriveFlow fleet reservation system"><div class="project-body"><h3>Fleet Operations</h3><ul class="project-points"><li><strong>The Tech:</strong> Reservation engine, fleet data model, availability dashboard, and cloud-hosted application environment.</li><li><strong>The Workflow:</strong> Booking requests update vehicle availability and scheduling logic without manual coordination.</li><li><strong>The Business Impact:</strong> Gives rental operators a more autonomous scheduling workflow and clearer fleet utilization.</li></ul><a class="status" href="https://driveflow.maamlyn.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Live Project ↗</a></div></article><article class="project"><img src="{{ asset('images/ecommerce-web-app-thumbnail.png') }}" alt="E-commerce web application"><div class="project-body"><h3>Commerce Platform</h3><p>A structured storefront experience with product discovery, cart logic, checkout pathways, and operational sales views.</p><a class="status" href="https://ecommerce-rctolosa-sample.maamlyn.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Live Project ↗</a></div></article><article class="project"><img src="{{ asset('images/sales-funnel-online-coaches-thumbnail.png') }}" alt="Sales funnel system for online coaches"><div class="project-body"><h3>Conversion System</h3><p>A conversion-focused acquisition system that moves qualified prospects from offer discovery to calls and program enrollment.</p><a class="status" href="https://salesfunnel.maamlyn.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Live Project ↗</a></div></article></div></div></section><section class="section" id="process"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">How I work</div><h2>Structured delivery. No operational surprises.</h2><p class="intro">A consultative process that connects technical decisions to the business result you need.</p><div class="process"><article><div class="tag">01 / Diagnose</div><h3>Define the operating problem</h3><p>Map the current process, identify failure points, and establish the measurable outcome that matters.</p></article><article><div class="tag">02 / Design</div><h3>Architect the solution</h3><p>Translate requirements into application structure, integration logic, data flows, and a clear delivery plan.</p></article><article><div class="tag">03 / Build</div><h3>Engineer and validate</h3><p>Develop the system through rapid, controlled iterations with testing, version history, and operational documentation.</p></article><article><div class="tag">04 / Deploy</div><h3>Launch with ownership</h3><p>Move through staging into production, verify the live workflow, and hand over complete code ownership.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section about" id="about"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">About Ronalyn</div><h2>Engineering leverage for ambitious operators.</h2><p>I am a full-stack developer and integration engineer focused on building software that improves how businesses operate. I use rapid application development and AI-assisted engineering to move from requirements to working systems with speed, structure, and production discipline.</p><p>My work connects interfaces, business logic, data, and infrastructure into dependable operating systems—so teams can reduce manual effort, respond faster, and maintain ownership of the technology that powers their business.</p></div><div><div class="eyebrow">Technical capabilities</div><div class="stack"><div>Webhooks<small>Event-driven integration logic</small></div><div>REST APIs<small>System-to-system connectivity</small></div><div>JSON Data Pipelines<small>Structured data movement</small></div><div>Google Stitch<small>Interface and layout design</small></div><div>GitHub + Git<small>Version control and release management</small></div><div>Cloud Infrastructure<small>Staging and production launch on any hosting provider or Linux VPS</small></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section contact" id="contact"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Start a technical conversation</div><h2>What would your business run better without?</h2><p>Share the workflow, bottleneck, or manual process limiting your team. I can help scope the right full-stack system or custom integration to remove it.</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="{{ route('contact') }}">Discuss Your System →</a><a class="secondary" href="#work">Review Live Systems</a></div></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap"><span>© {{ date('Y') }} Ronalyn Tolosa</span><span>Full-Stack Developer &amp; Integration Engineer</span></div></footer></body></html>
